WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.100 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  stridor is the sort of man who flies a  hang-glider into a war zone he doesn't  get bogged down in the little details  and his latest hack and slash action  game is the same way without preamble or  pretext you're dropped straight into the  action cleaving through one hapless  guard after another Striders capacity  for carnage is boundless and the  acrobatic precision with which he  dispatches his foes makes him a delight  to control and as your arsenal grows so  too will your enjoyment of this  well-crafted game simply put Strider  feels great to play from the arc of his  jump to the range of his slide although  Striders movements are perfectly  measured to give you complete command  over the action in the beginning you can  do a little more than jump and slash but  by exploring the world and defeating  powerful bosses Strider unlocks new  techniques for his arsenal reflecting  bullets throwing knives and summoning an  eagle made of pure energy are just some  of the powers you earn and they expand  your fighting repertoire in new and  interesting ways unlocking new powers  also lets you unlock new doors each  upgrade for Striders weapon referred to  as a cipher unlocks a certain type of  door which means you'll need to  backtrack to previously explored areas  to either advance in the story or  discover unlockables such as concept art  or new costumes whilst Ryder's world is  filled with surprises the backdrop  itself is rather drab the moment you  touch down you're greeted with this  futuristic industrial aesthetic that  follows you wherever you go  admittedly this style does have the  benefit of making Strider and all his  Crimson scarfed glory pop against the  background but even so a little more  variety would have been welcomed certain  enemies also sport a splash of color to  indicate a weakness to a particular  cypher against such foes Strider must  switch to the appropriate cypher and use  it to disable the enemy's defenses these  enemies help keep fights feeling dynamic  as they force you to mix up your tactics  and utilise Strider to his fullest  once you've finished Striders made  adventure you can try your hand at the  game's challenge modes these challenges  come in two varieties survival and  beacon run  survival challenges are all about  testing your combat prowess while beacon  runs are all about speed and agility  beacon runs are especially welcome since  Strider is so fun to control and the  main game rarely tests your platforming  capabilities when a challenge is  completed you are graded on your  performance and can compare your stats  against others on challenge specific  leaderboards from the moment you embark  on your journey right up until the final  death blow Strider is a blast to play  controlling the agile ninja feels  empowering right out of the gate and  each new upgrade brings with it an  enjoyable new way to engage your foes  while his world is a little drab there's  still plenty to explore even after the  job is done Strider is fun pure and  simple and serves as a fitting revival  of a classic video game hero  [Music]

